#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "How many attempts"
msgstr "Ọnụ ọgụgụ mgbalị ole"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Cacti attempts to run each test multiple times. The first successful attempt ends the testing and records the success. If none of the attempts are successful, the test is terminated and a failure is recorded. High number causes log test duration."
msgstr "Cacti na-anwa ịme ule ọ bụla ọtụtụ ugboro. Mbọ mbụ gara nke ọma na-akwụsị ule ahụ ma dekọọ ihe ịga nke ọma ahụ. Ọ bụrụ na ọ dịghị mbọ ọ bụla gara nke ọma, a na-akwụsị ule ahụ ma dekọọ ọdịda. Ọnụọgụgụ dị elu na-ebute ogologo oge ule."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Enable test"
msgstr "Gbanye ule"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Uncheck this box to disable this test from being checked."
msgstr "Wepụ akara n'igbe a iji gbanyụọ nyocha a ka a ghara ilele ya."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Enable run script for this test"
msgstr "Gbanye ịgba script maka ule a"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "If the global Command Execution function is enabled, you can set here whether the script should be run for this test or not."
msgstr "Ọ bụrụ na agbanyere ọrụ Mmezu Iwu zuru ụwa ọnụ, ị nwere ike ịhazi ebe a ma script a ga-agba maka ule a ma ọ bụ na ọ gaghị."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Poller"
msgstr "Poller"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Poller on which the test will run"
msgstr "Poller nke nnwale a ga-agba na ya"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Type of service"
msgstr "Ụdị ọrụ"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "What type of service?"
msgstr "Kedu ụdị ọrụ?"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "IP Address or DNS name of server"
msgstr "Adreesị IP ma ọ bụ aha DNS nke sava"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "You can specify another port (example.com:5000) otherwise default will be used. For IPv6 numeric address use [ip:ad:dr:es:fo:rma:at]. For DOH (DNS over HTTPS) use here name of server (example 10.10.10.10, cloudflare-dns.com, ..)"
msgstr "Ị nwere ike ịkọwapụta pọtụ ọzọ (example.com:5000) ma ọ bụghị ya a ga-eji nke ndabara. Maka adreesị ọnụọgụgụ IPv6 jiri [ip:ad:dr:es:fo:rma:at]. Maka DOH (DNS over HTTPS) jiri aha sava ebe a (dị ka 10.10.10.10, cloudflare-dns.com, ..)"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Resolve DNS to Address"
msgstr "Tọghata DNS ka ọ bụrụ Adreesị"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Enter an IP Address to force DNS name to resolve to. Leaving blank will use DNS Resolution instead."
msgstr "Tinye Adreesị IP iji manye aha DNS ka ọ dozie na ya. Ịhapụ oghere ga-eji Mkpebi DNS kama."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Service settings"
msgstr "Ntọala ọrụ"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Select correct credential"
msgstr "Họrọ asambodo ziri ezi"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "SNMP OID"
msgstr "SNMP OID"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Insert SNMP OID"
msgstr "Tinye SNMP OID"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "SSH command"
msgstr "Iwu SSH"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Insert SSH command with full path, result of command will be returned"
msgstr "Tinye iwu SSH na ụzọ zuru ezu, a ga-eweghachi nsonaazụ iwu ahụ"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Your own CA and intermediate certs"
msgstr "Asambodo CA na asambodo etiti nke gị"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "LDAP Search"
msgstr "Ọchụchọ LDAP"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "LDAP search filter, it could be ,OU=anygroup,DC=example,DC=com"
msgstr "Nzacha ọchụchọ LDAP, ọ nwere ike ịbụ ,OU=anygroup,DC=example,DC=com"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "DNS Name for Query"
msgstr "Aha DNS maka Ajụjụ"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "DNS name for querying. For DOH (DNS over HTTPS) use /resolve?name=example.com or /dns-query?name=example.com&type=A. For plaintext DNS A and AAAA records will be returned"
msgstr "Aha DNS maka ịjụ ajụjụ. Maka DOH (DNS over HTTPS) jiri /resolve?name=example.com ma ọ bụ /dns-query?name=example.com&type=A. Maka DNS ederede nkịtị, a ga-eweghachi ndekọ A na AAAA"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Path Part of URL"
msgstr "Akụkụ Ụzọ nke URL"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "For web service insert at least \"/\" or something like \"/any/path/\"."
msgstr "Maka ọrụ webụ, tinye opekata mpe \"/\" maọbụ ihe dịka \"/any/path/\"."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Requires Authentication"
msgstr "Chọrọ Nkwenye Njirimara"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Check this box if the site will normally return a 401 Error as it requires a username and password."
msgstr "Kaa akara n'igbe a ma ọ bụrụ na saịtị ahụ na-eweghachi Njehie 401 n'ihi na ọ chọrọ aha njirimara na okwuntụghe."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Proxy Server"
msgstr "Sava Proxy"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "If this connection text requires a proxy, select it here.  Otherwise choose 'None'."
msgstr "Ọ bụrụ na ederede njikọ a chọrọ proxy, họrọ ya ebe a.  Ma ọ bụghị ya họrọ 'Ọ dịghị'."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Check Certificate"
msgstr "Lelee Asambodo"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "If using SSL, check this box if you want to validate the certificate. Default on, turn off if you the site uses a self-signed certificate."
msgstr "Ọ bụrụ na ị na-eji SSL, kaa igbe a akara ma ọ bụrụ na ịchọrọ ịkwado asambodo ahụ. Gbanyere na ndabara, gbanyụọ ma ọ bụrụ na saịtị ahụ na-eji asambodo bịanyere aka n'onwe ya."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Check and notify Certificate expiration"
msgstr "Lelee ma mee ọkwa njedebe Asambodo"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "If using SSL, check this box if you want to check the certificate expiration. You can set in settings how many days before expiration notify.."
msgstr "Ọ bụrụ na ị na-eji SSL, kaa igbe a akara ma ọ bụrụ na ịchọrọ ịlele mgbe asambodo ga-agwụ. Ị nwere ike ịhazi na ntọala ụbọchị ole tupu oge ngwụcha ka a gwa gị.."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Parameters"
msgstr "Paramita gasị"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "How Often to Test"
msgstr "Ugboro Ole a ga-anwale"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Test every xth poller run"
msgstr "Nwalee ọsọ poller nke x ọ bụla"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Trigger"
msgstr "Mkpali"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "How many times the service must be DOWN before an alert email is triggered."
msgstr "Ugboro ole ka ọrụ ahụ ga-anọ n'ọnọdụ DARA tupu e kpalite ozi-e ọkwa mgbaama."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Long duration alert"
msgstr "Ọkwa ogologo oge"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "If the test time is greater than this value more times in a row, send a notification. Related to variable Duration count. The test inherits the maximum runtime from the settings. If a higher value is set here, the maximum runtime is this value + 2 seconds."
msgstr "Ọ bụrụ na oge ule dị ukwuu karịa uru a ọtụtụ ugboro n'usoro, zipụ ọkwa. Jikọtara ya na mgbanwe Ọnụ ọgụgụ Ogologo oge. Ule ahụ na-eketa oge ọsọ kachasị elu site na ntọala. Ọ bụrụ na edobere uru dị elu karịa ebe a, oge ọsọ kachasị elu bụ uru a + sekọnd 2."

#: includes/arrays.php
