#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "This is the string to search for on the Maintenance .  The Service Check will check for this string if the above string is not found.  If found, it means that the service is under maintenance."
msgstr "Nke a bụ eriri ederede a ga-achọ na Ndozi . Nnyocha Ọrụ ga-elele maka eriri ederede a ma ọ bụrụ na ahụghị eriri dị n'elu. Ọ bụrụ na a hụ ya, ọ pụtara na a na-edozi ọrụ ahụ."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Response Search String - Failed"
msgstr "Eriri Ọchụchọ Nzaghachi - Dara"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "This is the string to search for a known failure in the service response.  The Service Check will only alert if this string is found, ignoring any timeout issues and the search strings above."
msgstr "Nke a bụ eriri ederede a ga-achọ maka ọdịda a maara na nzaghachi ọrụ. Nnyocha Ọrụ ga-enye ọkwa naanị ma ọ bụrụ na a hụrụ eriri ederede a, na-eleghara nsogbu nkwụsị oge na eriri nchọta dị n'elu anya."

