#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "<b>Can be used for a lot of service checks:</b><br/><i>Http/https</i> - optional, when it is set, try HTTP basic auth<br/><i>SMTP on port 587</i> - optional. Without a username/password, only the server response is tested. With a username and password, login is also performed<br/><i>Imap, imaps, pop3, pop3s, ftp</i> - optional. For anonymous ftp, use username \"anonymous\" and email address as password<br/><i>LDAP, smb, smbs</i> - required<br/><i>MQTT</i> - optional<br/><i>SCP, SSH command</i> - you can use this method or private key method"
msgstr "<b>Enwere ike iji ya maka ọtụtụ nyocha ọrụ:</b><br/><i>Http/https</i> - nhọrọ, mgbe edobere ya, nwaa njikọ HTTP basic auth<br/><i>SMTP na ọdụ ụgbọ 587</i> - nhọrọ. Enweghị aha njirimara/okwuntụghe, naanị nzaghachi sava ka a na-anwale. Site na aha njirimara na okwuntụghe, a na-emekwa nbanye<br/><i>Imap, imaps, pop3, pop3s, ftp</i> - nhọrọ. Maka ftp na-enweghị aha, jiri aha njirimara \"anonymous\" na adreesị ozi-e dị ka okwuntụghe<br/><i>LDAP, smb, smbs</i> - dị mkpa<br/><i>MQTT</i> - nhọrọ<br/><i>Iwu SCP, SSH</i> - ị nwere ike iji usoro a ma ọ bụ usoro igodo nzuzo"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Rest API - Basic HTTP auth. Username and password are required"
msgstr "Rest API - Nkwenye HTTP dị mfe. A chọrọ aha njirimara na okwuntụghe"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Rest API - API key auth<br/>Auth is sent in HTTP header, custom header or POST method. Credentials in URL are not supported.<br/>Insert API key name and value. Both values are required. For HTTP header the name <i>Bearer or apikey or \"\"</i> is usually used (Authorization: Bearer apivalue). For custom header <i>X-API-Key</i> is usually used (X-Api-Key: keyvalue). For POST <i>api_key</i> is usually used."
msgstr "Rest API - Nkwenye igodo API<br/>A na-eziga nkwenye n'isi HTTP, isi omenala ma ọ bụ usoro POST. Akwadoghị nzere n'ime URL.<br/>Tinye aha igodo API na uru ya. A chọrọ uru abụọ ahụ. Maka isi HTTP a na-ejikarị aha <i>Bearer ma ọ bụ apikey ma ọ bụ \"\"</i> (Authorization: Bearer apivalue). Maka isi omenala a na-ejikarị <i>X-API-Key</i> (X-Api-Key: keyvalue). Maka POST a na-ejikarị <i>api_key</i>."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Rest API - OAuth2/Bearer token auth<br/>You can have key/token from server and insert it here or use auth flow with credentials. Username and password are sent Json encoded."
msgstr "Rest API - Nkwenye token OAuth2/Bearer<br/>Ị nwere ike ịnweta igodo/token site na sava wee tinye ya ebe a ma ọ bụ jiri usoro nkwenye na nzere. A na-eziga aha njirimara na okwuntụghe na koodu Json."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Rest API - Cookie based auth - both values are required. After login, cookie is returned"
msgstr "Rest API - Nkwenye dabere na Cookie - a chọrọ uru abụọ ahụ. Mgbe nbanye gasịrị, a na-eweghachi cookie"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "SNMP v1 or v2 - required, insert community name here"
msgstr "SNMP v1 ma ọ bụ v2 - achọrọ, tinye aha obodo ebe a"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "SNMP v3 - The security level determines which parameters are required"
msgstr "SNMP v3 - Ọkwa nchekwa na-ekpebi paramita ndị achọrọ"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "SSH private key - Can be used for SCP or SSH command test. These test can use username/password too"
msgstr "Igodo nzuzo SSH - Enwere ike iji ya maka ule iwu SCP ma ọ bụ SSH. Ule ndị a nwere ike iji aha njirimara/okwuntụghe kwa"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "It only checks whether the web server is responding. If username/password credential is used, it will try Basic HTTP auth."
msgstr "Ọ na-elele naanị ma sava weebụ ọ na-aza. Ọ bụrụ na ejiri nzere aha njirimara/okwuntụghe, ọ ga-anwale nkwenye Basic HTTP."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "The same as HTTP plaintext but adds the ability to test certificates."
msgstr "Otu ihe ahụ dịka ederede doro anya HTTP mana ọ na-agbakwunye ike ịnwale asambodo."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "It only checks whether the SMTP server is responding. No authentication. You will see server login banner and ehlo response."
msgstr "Ọ na-elele naanị ma sava SMTP ọ na-aza. Enweghị nkwenye njirimara. Ị ga-ahụ ọkwa nbanye sava na nzaghachi ehlo."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Unencrypted + STARTTLS. It is also possible to test the validity of the certificate. Without username and password, you will see server login banner and ehlo response. With credential, login will be performed"
msgstr "Enweghị nzuzo + STARTTLS. O kwekwara omume ịnwale izi ezi nke asambodo. Na-enweghị aha njirimara na okwuntụghe, ị ga-ahụ ọkọlọtọ mbanye sava na nzaghachi ehlo. Na nzere, a ga-eme nbanye"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Encrypted connection on default port 465. It is also possible to test the validity of the certificate. With username and password AUTH LOGIN will be tested."
msgstr "Njikọ e zoro ezo na ọdụ ụgbọ mmiri ndabara 465. Ọ dịkwa mfe ịnwale izi ezi nke asambodo ahụ. Site na aha njirimara na okwuntụghe a ga-anwale AUTH LOGIN."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Unencrypted IMAP connection. Without credential, only connection will be tested. You will see only login banner. With credential login will be tested and try to read list of messages. You can use AUTHENTICATE PLAIN or AUTHENTICATE LOGIN method."
msgstr "Njikọ IMAP na-enweghị nzuzo. Na-enweghị nzere, naanị njikọ ka a ga-anwale. Ị ga-ahụ naanị ọkọlọtọ mbanye. Na nzere, a ga-anwale nbanye ma nwaa ịgụ ndepụta ozi. Ị nwere ike iji usoro AUTHENTICATE PLAIN ma ọ bụ AUTHENTICATE LOGIN."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "The same as unencrypted IMAP but after login STARTTLS is used. It is also possible to test the validity of the certificate after STARTTLS."
msgstr "Otu ihe ahụ dịka IMAP na-enweghị izo ya ezo mana mgbe ịbanye gasịrị a na-eji STARTTLS. O kwere omume ịnwale izi ezi nke asambodo ahụ mgbe STARTTLS gasịrị."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Encrypted IMAP, you can try login and test certificate and user login"
msgstr "IMAP e zoro ezo, ị nwere ike ịnwale nbanye ma nwalee asambodo na nbanye onye ọrụ"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Unencrypted POP3 connection. Without credential, only connection will be tested. You will see only login banner. With credential login will be tested and try to read list of messages"
msgstr "Njikọ POP3 na-enweghị nzuzo. Na-enweghị nzere, naanị njikọ ka a ga-anwale. Ị ga-ahụ naanị ọkọlọtọ mbanye. Na nzere, a ga-anwale nbanye ma nwaa ịgụ ndepụta ozi"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "The same as unencrypted POP3 but after login STARTTLS is used. It is also possible to test the validity of the certificate after STARTTLS."
msgstr "Otu ihe ahụ dịka POP3 na-enweghị izo ya ezo mana mgbe ịbanye gasịrị a na-eji STARTTLS. O kwere omume ịnwale izi ezi nke asambodo ahụ mgbe STARTTLS gasịrị."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Encrypted POP3, you can try login and test certificate and user login."
msgstr "POP3 e zoro ezo, ị nwere ike ịnwale nbanye ma nwalee asambodo na nbanye onye ọrụ."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Try to resolve DNS record on specified DNS server"
msgstr "Gbalịa dozie ndekọ DNS na sava DNS akọwapụtara"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Try DNS over HTTPS."
msgstr "Nwalee DNS site na HTTPS."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "All parameters are required. Perform unencrypted LDAP login and search"
msgstr "Achọrọ paramita nile. Mee nbanye na nchọta LDAP a na-ezoghị ezo"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "All parameters are required. Perform encrypted LDAP login and search"
msgstr "Achọrọ paramita nile. Mee nbanye na nchọta LDAP ezoro ezo"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Unencrypted FTP connection, login and try to download file specified in path (/path/to/file.txt). For anonymous connection use login *anonymous* and email address as password. The content of the file is returned."
msgstr "Njikọ FTP na-enweghị nzuzo, banye ma nwaa ibudata faịlụ akọwapụtara n'ụzọ (/path/to/file.txt). Maka njikọ amaghị aha jiri mbanye *anonymous* na adreesị ozi-e dị ka okwuntụghe. A na-eweghachi ọdịnaya nke faịlụ ahụ."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Try to download file specified in path (/path/to/file.txt) from TFTP server. The content of the file is returned."
msgstr "Gbalịa budata faịlụ akọwapụtara n'ụzọ (/path/to/file.txt) site na sava TFTP. A ga-eweghachi ọdịnaya nke faịlụ ahụ."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Encrypted SCP connection, login and try to download file specified in path (/path/to/file.txt)."
msgstr "Njikọ SCP e zoro ezo, banye ma nwaa ibudata faịlụ e kwuru na ụzọ (/path/to/file.txt)."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Try SMB protocol, username and password are required. Try to login and download file."
msgstr "Nwalee usoro SMB, achọrọ aha njirimara na okwuntụghe. Gbalịa banye ma budata faịlụ."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Connect to MQTT server and listen for any message. You can specify topic in Path (bedroom/temp), blank for any topic. For this test is recommended increase \"Long duration alert\""
msgstr "Jikọọ na sava MQTT ma gee ntị maka ozi ọ bụla. Ị nwere ike ịkọwapụta isiokwu na Ụzọ (bedroom/temp), hapụ ya efu maka isiokwu ọ bụla. Maka ule a, a na-atụ aro ka iwelie \"Ịdọ aka ná ntị ogologo oge\""

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "REST API test with basic HTTP auth. Prepare credential first."
msgstr "Nnwale REST API jiri nkwenye HTTP nkịtị. Kwado nzere mbụ."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "REST API test with API key auth. Prepare credential first."
msgstr "Nnwale REST API jiri nkwenye igodo API. Kwado nzere mbụ."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "REST API test with Oauth2. Prepare credential first."
msgstr "Nnwale REST API jiri Oauth2. Kwado nzere mbụ."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "REST API test with cookie auth. Prepare credential first."
msgstr "Nnwale REST API jiri nkwenye kuki. Kwado nzere mbụ."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Try SNMP get method. Output for specified OID is returned. Credential is required, you have to prepare SNMP v.1,2 or v3 credential first."
msgstr "Nwalee usoro SNMP get. A ga-eweghachi nsonaazụ maka OID akọwapụtara. Achọrọ asambodo nzuzo, ị ga-ebu ụzọ kwadebe asambodo SNMP v.1,2 ma ọ bụ v3."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Try SNMP walk method. Output for specified OID is returned. Credential is required, you have to prepare SNMP v.1,2 or v3 credential first."
msgstr "Nwalee usoro SNMP walk. A ga-eweghachi nsonaazụ maka OID akọwapụtara. Achọrọ asambodo nzuzo, ị ga-ebu ụzọ kwadebe asambodo SNMP v.1,2 ma ọ bụ v3."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Use ssh and connect to remote host. After login run specified command and return output. Username and password or private key is possible."
msgstr "Jiri SSH jikọọ na onye nnabata dị anya. Mgbe ị banyechara, mee iwu akọwapụtara ma weghachite nsonaazụ. Aha njirimara na okwuntụghe ma ọ bụ igodo nzuzo ga-ekwe omume."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "SFTP protocol on port 22, username and password and path are required. Try to do directory listing of path."
msgstr "Usoro SFTP na port 22, a chọrọ aha njirimara na okwuntụghe na ụzọ. Gbalịa ime ndepụta ndekọ nke ụzọ ahụ."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "All fine. Proceed as usual."
msgstr "Ihe nile dị mma. Gaa n'ihu dị ka ọ na-adị."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "The URL you passed to libcurl used a protocol that this libcurl does not support. The support might be a compile-time option that you did not use, it can be a misspelled protocol string or just a protocol libcurl has no code for."
msgstr "URL ị gafere na libcurl jiri usoro nkwukọrịta nke libcurl a na-akwadoghị. Nkwado ahụ nwere ike ịbụ nhọrọ n'oge nchịkọta nke ị na-ejighị, ọ nwere ike ịbụ mkpụrụokwu usoro e dere na-ezighị ezi ma ọ bụ naanị usoro nke libcurl enweghị koodu maka ya."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Early initialization code failed. This is likely to be an internal error or problem, or a resource problem where something fundamental could not get done at init time."
msgstr "Koodu mmalite nke mbụ dara. Nke a nwere ike ịbụ njọ ma ọ bụ nsogbu dị n'ime, ma ọ bụ nsogbu akụrụngwa ebe a na-enweghị ike ime ihe dị mkpa n'oge mmalite."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "The URL was not properly formatted."
msgstr "Ahazighị URL ahụ nke ọma."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "A requested feature, protocol or option was not found built-in in this libcurl due to a build-time decision. This means that a feature or option was not enabled or explicitly disabled when libcurl was built and in order to get it to function you have to get a rebuilt libcurl."
msgstr "Achọtaghị atụmatụ, usoro ma ọ bụ nhọrọ a rịọrọ n'ime libcurl a n'ihi mkpebi oge nrụnye. Nke a pụtara na agbanyeghị atụmatụ ma ọ bụ nhọrọ ahụ ma ọ bụ gbanyụọ ya nke ọma mgbe e wuru libcurl, ma iji mee ka ọ rụọ ọrụ ị ga-enweta libcurl e wugharịrị."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Could not resolve proxy. The given proxy host could not be resolved."
msgstr "Enweghị ike idozi prọksị. Enweghị ike idozi onye nnabata prọksị enyere."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Could not resolve host. The given remote host was not resolved."
msgstr "Enweghị ike idozi onye nnabata. Edozighị onye nnabata dịpụrụ adịpụ enyere."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Failed to connect() to host or proxy."
msgstr "Emezighị ijikọ connect() na onye nnabata ma ọ bụ proxy."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "The server sent data libcurl could not parse. This error code was known as CURLE_FTP_WEIRD_SERVER_REPLY before 7.51.0."
msgstr "Sava ahụ zipụrụ data nke libcurl na-enweghị ike ịkọwa. A maara koodu njehie a dịka CURLE_FTP_WEIRD_SERVER_REPLY tupu 7.51.0."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "We were denied access to the resource given in the URL. For FTP, this occurs while trying to change to the remote directory."
msgstr "E gbochiri anyị ịnweta ihe enyere na URL. Maka FTP, nke a na-eme mgbe a na-anwa ịgbanwe gaa na ndekọ dị n'ebe dị anya."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "While waiting for the server to connect back when an active FTP session is used, an error code was sent over the control connection or similar."
msgstr "Mgbe a na-eche ka sava jikọọ azụ mgbe a na-eji oge FTP na-arụ ọrụ, e zipụrụ koodu njehie n'elu njikọ njikwa ma ọ bụ ihe yiri ya."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "After having sent the FTP password to the server, libcurl expects a proper reply. This error code indicates that an unexpected code was returned."
msgstr "Mgbe ezitere okwuntụghe FTP na sava ahụ, libcurl na-atụ anya nzaghachi kwesịrị ekwesị. Koodu njehie a na-egosi na eweghachiri koodu a na-atụghị anya ya."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "During an active FTP session while waiting for the server to connect, the CURLOPT_ACCEPTTIMEOUT_MS (or the internal default) timeout expired."
msgstr "N'oge nnọkọ FTP na-arụ ọrụ mgbe a na-eche ka sava jikọọ, oge nkwụsị CURLOPT_ACCEPTTIMEOUT_MS (ma ọ bụ ndabere dị n'ime) agwụla."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Libcurl failed to get a sensible result back from the server as a response to either a PASV or a EPSV command. The server is flawed."
msgstr "Libcurl enweghị ike ịnweta nsonaazụ ziri ezi site na sava dị ka nzaghachi nye iwu PASV ma ọ bụ EPSV. Sava ahụ nwere ntụpọ."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "FTP servers return a 227-line as a response to a PASV command. If libcurl fails to parse that line, this return code is passed back."
msgstr "Ndị nkesa FTP na-eweghachi ahịrị 227 dị ka nzaghachi nye iwu PASV. Ọ bụrụ na libcurl agaghị atụgharị ahịrị ahụ, a na-eweghachi koodu nloghachi a."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "An internal failure to lookup the host used for the new connection."
msgstr "Ọdịda dị n'ime n'ịchọ onye nnabata ejiri maka njikọ ọhụrụ ahụ."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "A problem was detected in the HTTP2 framing layer. This is somewhat generic and can be one out of several problems, see the error buffer for details."
msgstr "Achọpụtara nsogbu na ọkwa nhazi HTTP2. Nke a bụ ihe zuru oke ma nwee ike ịbụ otu n'ime ọtụtụ nsogbu, lee nchekwa njehie maka nkọwa."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Received an error when trying to set the transfer mode to binary or ASCII."
msgstr "Natara njehie mgbe a na-anwa ịtọ ọnọdụ nnyefe ka ọ bụrụ binary ma ọ bụ ASCII."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "A file transfer was shorter or larger than expected. This happens when the server first reports an expected transfer size, and then delivers data that does not match the previously given size."
msgstr "Nyefe faịlụ dị mkpụmkpụ ma ọ bụ buo ibu karịa ka a tụrụ anya ya. Nke a na-eme mgbe sava buru ụzọ kọọ nha nyefe a tụrụ anya ya, wee zipụta data na-adabaghị na nha e nyere na mbụ."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "This was either a weird reply to a 'RETR' command or a zero byte transfer complete."
msgstr "Nke a bụ ma ọ bụ azịza dị iche nye iwu 'RETR' ma ọ bụ mbufe byte efu zuru ezu."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Obsolete Error"
msgstr "Njehie Ochie"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Not used in modern versions."
msgstr "Ejighị ya eme ihe na nsụgharị ọgbara ọhụrụ."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "When sending custom \"QUOTE\" commands to the remote server, one of the commands returned an error code that was 400 or higher (for FTP) or otherwise indicated unsuccessful completion of the command."
msgstr "Mgbe ị na-ezigara sava dị anya iwu \"QUOTE\" ahaziri ahazi, otu n'ime iwu ndị ahụ weghachiri koodu njehie nke dị 400 ma ọ bụ karịa (maka FTP) ma ọ bụ gosi na mmezu iwu ahụ agaghị nke ọma."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "This is returned if CURLOPT_FAILONERROR is set true and the HTTP server returns an error code that is >= 400."
msgstr "A na-eweghachi nke a ma ọ bụrụ na etinyere CURLOPT_FAILONERROR ka ọ bụrụ eziokwu ma sava HTTP weghachi koodu njehie nke bụ >= 400."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "An error occurred when writing received data to a local file, or an error was returned to libcurl from a write callback."
msgstr "Mperi mere mgbe a na-ede data anatara n'ime faịlụ dị n'ime, ma ọ bụ e weghachiri mperi na libcurl site na write callback."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Failed starting the upload. For FTP, the server typically denied the STOR command. The error buffer usually contains the server's explanation for this."
msgstr "Emezighị ịmalite mbulite. Maka FTP, onye nkesa na-ajụkarị iwu STOR. Ebe nchekwa njehie na-enwekarị nkọwa onye nkesa maka nke a."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "There was a problem reading a local file or an error returned by the read callback."
msgstr "Nsogbu dapụtara n'ịgụ faịlụ mpaghara ma ọ bụ njehie si na callback ọgụgụ lọta."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "A memory allocation request failed. This is serious badness and things are severely screwed up if this ever occurs."
msgstr "Arịrịọ nkesa ebe nchekwa dara. Nke a bụ nnukwu nsogbu na ihe mebiri emebi nke ukwuu ma ọ bụrụ na nke a emee."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Operation timeout. The specified time-out period was reached according to the conditions."
msgstr "Oge ọrụ agwụla. E ruru oge nkwụsị a kapịrị ọnụ dịka ọnọdụ ndị ahụ si dị."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "The FTP PORT command returned error. This mostly happens when you have not specified a good enough address for libcurl to use. See CURLOPT_FTPPORT."
msgstr "Iwu FTP PORT weghachiri mperi. Nke a na-emekarị mgbe ị kọwapụtabeghị adreesị zuru oke maka libcurl iji. Lee CURLOPT_FTPPORT."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "The FTP REST command returned error. This should never happen if the server is sane."
msgstr "Iwu FTP REST weghachiri mperi. Nke a ekwesịghị ime ma ọlị ma ọ bụrụ na sava ahụ dị mma."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "The server does not support or accept range requests."
msgstr "Sava ahụ anaghị akwado maọbụ nabata arịrịọ oke."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "This is an odd error that mainly occurs due to internal confusion."
msgstr "Nke a bụ njehie pụrụ iche nke na-emekarị n'ihi mgbagwoju anya dị n'ime."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "A problem occurred somewhere in the SSL/TLS handshake. You really want the error buffer and read the message there as it pinpoints the problem slightly more. Could be certificates (file formats, paths, permissions), passwords, and others."
msgstr "Nsogbu mere ebe dị na nkwurịta SSL/TLS. Ị ga-achọ nchekwa njehie ma gụọ ozi dị n'ebe ahụ n'ihi na ọ na-egosipụta nsogbu ahụ ntakịrị karị. O nwere ike ịbụ asambodo (ụdị faịlụ, ụzọ, ikike), okwuntụghe, na ndị ọzọ."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "The download could not be resumed because the specified offset was out of the file boundary."
msgstr "Enweghị ike ịmaliteghachi nbudata ahụ n'ihi na ngafe a kọwapụtara karịrị ókè faịlụ ahụ."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "A file given with FILE:// could not be opened. Most likely because the file path does not identify an existing file. Did you check file permissions?"
msgstr "Enweghị ike imeghe faịlụ e nyere na FILE://. O yikarịrị n'ihi na ụzọ faịlụ ahụ anaghị egosi faịlụ dị adị. Ị nyochara ikike faịlụ?"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "LDAP cannot bind. LDAP bind operation failed."
msgstr "LDAP enweghị ike ijikọ. Ọrụ njikọ LDAP kụrụ afọ n'ala."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "LDAP search failed."
msgstr "Ọchụchọ LDAP kụrụ afọ n'ala."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Function not found. A required zlib function was not found."
msgstr "Ahụghị ọrụ. Ahụghị otu ọrụ zlib dị mkpa."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Aborted by callback. A callback returned \"abort\" to libcurl."
msgstr "Kagburu site na callback. Callback laghachiri \"abort\" na libcurl."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "A function was called with a bad parameter."
msgstr "A kpọrọ ọrụ na paramita na-adịghị mma."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Interface error. A specified outgoing interface could not be used. Set which interface to use for outgoing connections' source IP address with URLOPT_INTERFACE."
msgstr "Njehie ọnụ njikọ. Enweghị ike iji ọnụ njikọ mpụta akọwapụtara. Tọọ ọnụ njikọ a ga-eji maka adreesị IP isi iyi nke njikọ mpụta na URLOPT_INTERFACE."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Too many redirects. When following redirects, libcurl hit the maximum amount. Set your limit with CURLOPT_MAXREDIRS."
msgstr "Ntụgharị karịrị akarị. Mgbe ọ na-eso ntụgharị, libcurl ruru oke kachasị. Tọọ oke gị na CURLOPT_MAXREDIRS."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "An option passed to libcurl is not recognized/known. Refer to the appropriate documentation. This is most likely a problem in the program that uses libcurl. The error buffer might contain more specific information about which exact option it concerns."
msgstr "A mataghị/amaghị nhọrọ e zigara libcurl. Rụtụ aka na akwụkwọ kwesịrị ekwesị. Nke a nwere ike ịbụ nsogbu na mmemme na-eji libcurl. Ebe nchekwa mperi nwere ike inwe ozi doro anya karị banyere kpọmkwem nhọrọ ọ metụtara."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "An option passed in to a setopt was wrongly formatted. See error message for details about what option."
msgstr "Nhọrọ e tinyere na setopt nwere usoro ezighị ezi. Lee ozi mperi maka nkọwa banyere nhọrọ ahụ."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Nothing was returned from the server, and under the circumstances, getting nothing is considered an error."
msgstr "Enweghị ihe si na sava lọta, na n'ọnọdụ a, enwetaghị ihe ọ bụla bụ njehie."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "The specified crypto engine was not found."
msgstr "Ahụghị injin crypto akọwapụtara."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Failed setting the selected SSL crypto engine as default."
msgstr "Emezighị ịtọ igwe nzuzo SSL ahọpụtara ka ọ bụrụ ndabara."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Failed sending network data."
msgstr "Emezighị izipu data netwọk."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Failure with receiving network data."
msgstr "Ọdịda n'ịnata data netwọk."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "problem with the local client certificate."
msgstr "nsogbu dị na asambodo onye ahịa mpaghara."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Could not use specified cipher."
msgstr "Enweghị ike iji cipher akọwapụtara."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "The remote server's SSL certificate or SSH fingerprint was deemed not OK. This error code has been unified with CURLE_SSL_CACERT since 7.62.0. Its previous value was 51."
msgstr "E weere asambodo SSL maọbụ akara mkpịsị aka SSH nke sava dị anya dịka ihe adịghị mma. E jikọtara koodu njehie a na CURLE_SSL_CACERT kemgbe 7.62.0. Uru ya gara aga bụ 51."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Unrecognized transfer encoding."
msgstr "Ntinye koodu nnyefe a na-amataghị."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Maximum file size exceeded."
msgstr "A gafere oke faịlụ kacha elu."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Requested FTP SSL level failed."
msgstr "Ọkwa FTP SSL a rịọrọ dara."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "When doing a send operation curl had to rewind the data to retransmit, but the rewinding operation failed."
msgstr "Mgbe ọ na-arụ ọrụ izipu, curl ga-akpọghachi data azụ iji zipụ ọzọ, mana ọrụ nkpọghachi azụ ahụ dara ada."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Initiating the SSL Engine failed."
msgstr "Ịmalite Njịn SSL kụrụ afọ n'ala."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "The remote server denied curl to login (Added in 7.13.1)"
msgstr "Sava dị anya jụrụ curl ịbanye (Agbakwunyere na 7.13.1)"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "File not found on TFTP server."
msgstr "Achọtaghị faịlụ na onye nkesa TFTP."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Permission problem on TFTP server."
msgstr "Nsogbu ikike na sava TFTP."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Out of disk space on the server."
msgstr "Ohere diski agwụla na sava."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Illegal TFTP operation."
msgstr "Ọrụ TFTP na-akwadoghị."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Unknown TFTP transfer ID."
msgstr "NJ nnyefe TFTP amaghị."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "File already exists and is not overwritten."
msgstr "Faịlụ adịlarị ma edegharịghị ya."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "This error should never be returned by a properly functioning TFTP server."
msgstr "Sava TFTP na-arụ ọrụ nke ọma ekwesịghị eweghachi njehie a ma ọlị."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Problem with reading the SSL CA cert (path? access rights?)"
msgstr "Nsogbu n'ịgụ asambodo SSL CA (ụzọ? ikike nnweta?)"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "The resource referenced in the URL does not exist."
msgstr "Akụrụngwa a kpọtụrụ aha na URL adịghị."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "An unspecified error occurred during the SSH session."
msgstr "Mperi a na-akọwaghị mere n'oge nnọkọ SSH."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Failed to shut down the SSL connection."
msgstr "Emezighị imechi njikọ SSL."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Socket is not ready for send/recv wait till it's ready and try again. This return code is only returned from curl_easy_recv and curl_easy_send (Added in 7.18.2)"
msgstr "Socket adịghị njikere maka izipu/nnata, chere ruo mgbe ọ dị njikere ma nwaa ọzọ. A na-eweghachi koodu nloghachi a naanị site na curl_easy_recv na curl_easy_send (Etinyere na 7.18.2)"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Failed to load CRL file (Added in 7.19.0)"
msgstr "Emezighị ibudata faịlụ CRL (Etinyere na 7.19.0)"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Issuer check failed (Added in 7.19.0)"
msgstr "Nlele onye nyere ya kụrụ afọ n'ala (Agbakwunyere na 7.19.0)"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "The FTP server does not understand the PRET command at all or does not support the given argument. Be careful when using CURLOPT_CUSTOMREQUEST, a custom LIST command is sent with the PRET command before PASV as well. (Added in 7.20.0)"
msgstr "Sava FTP aghọtaghị iwu PRET ma ọlị ma ọ bụ anaghị akwado arụmụka e nyere. Kpachara anya mgbe ị na-eji CURLOPT_CUSTOMREQUEST, a na-eziga iwu LIST ahaziri iche yana iwu PRET tupu PASV kwa. (Etinyere na 7.20.0)"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Mismatch of RTSP CSeq numbers."
msgstr "Nọmba RTSP CSeq adabaghị."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Mismatch of RTSP Session Identifiers."
msgstr "Nchọpụta Oge RTSP adabaghị."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Unable to parse FTP file list (during FTP wildcard downloading)."
msgstr "Enweghị ike ịkọwa ndepụta faịlụ FTP (n'oge nbudata wildcard FTP)."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Chunk callback reported error."
msgstr "Nzaghachi nkeji kọrọ njehie."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "(For internal use only, is never returned by libcurl) No connection available, the session is queued. (added in 7.30.0)"
msgstr "(Maka iji n'ime naanị, libcurl anaghị eweghachi ya ma ọlị) Enweghị njikọ dị, e tinyere nnọkọ ahụ n'ahịrị. (agbakwunyere na 7.30.0)"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Failed to match the pinned key specified with CURLOPT_PINNEDPUBLICKEY."
msgstr "Emezighị ijikọ igodo etinyere nke akọwapụtara na CURLOPT_PINNEDPUBLICKEY."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Status returned failure when asked with CURLOPT_SSL_VERIFYSTATUS."
msgstr "Ọnọdụ weghachiri ọdịda mgbe e ji CURLOPT_SSL_VERIFYSTATUS jụọ ya."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Stream error in the HTTP/2 framing layer."
msgstr "Njehie iyi n'ime usoro nhazi HTTP/2."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "An API function was called from inside a callback."
msgstr "Akpọrọ ọrụ API site n'ime callback."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "An authentication function returned an error."
msgstr "Ọrụ nkwenye njirimara weghachiri mperi."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "A problem was detected in the HTTP/3 layer. This is somewhat generic and can be one out of several problems, see the error buffer for details."
msgstr "Achọpụtara nsogbu na ọkwa HTTP/3. Nke a bụ ihe zuru oke ma nwee ike ịbụ otu n'ime ọtụtụ nsogbu, lee nchekwa njehie maka nkọwa."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "QUIC connection error. This error may be caused by an SSL library error. QUIC is the protocol used for HTTP/3 transfers."
msgstr "Njehie njikọ QUIC. Njehie a nwere ike ịbụ n'ihi njehie ọba akwụkwọ SSL. QUIC bụ prọtokọl a na-eji maka mbufe HTTP/3."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Proxy handshake error. CURLINFO_PROXY_ERROR provides extra details on the specific problem."
msgstr "Njehie nkwenye njikọ proxy. CURLINFO_PROXY_ERROR na-enye nkọwa ndị ọzọ gbasara nsogbu ahụ kpọmkwem."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "SSL Client Certificate required."
msgstr "A chọrọ Asambodo Onye Ahịa SSL."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "An internal call to poll() or select() returned error that is not recoverable."
msgstr "Ọkpụkpọ dị n'ime na poll() ma ọ bụ select() weghachiri mperi na-agaghị agbake."

#: includes/functions.php
msgid "Log History"
msgstr "Akụkọ Ndekọ"

#: includes/functions.php
msgid "Graphs"
msgstr "Eserese Gasị"

#: includes/functions.php
msgid "No data"
msgstr "Enweghị data"

